Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.79,OP-Chi,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}静候死亡的审判
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:19.32,OP-Chi,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}我别无所求
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:22.56,OP-Chi,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}只想回到这里…
